    <section class="s rv" id="roadmap">
      <span class="eyebrow">The plan</span>
      <h2><span class="num">07</span>Roadmap</h2>
      <div class="road">
        <div class="phase"><div class="when">Cycle 0 · Pre-launch</div><h3>Foundations</h3><p>Identity, site, program audit. Seed the community, recruit meme creators, tease the burn.</p></div>
